1
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:07,312
Sometimes an agent is shown as busy while nothing is happening:

2
00:00:07,312 --> 00:00:12,200
a call that the provider already ended, a reservation that nothing backs, or

3
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:15,239
work still assigned with no call in progress.

4
00:00:15,239 --> 00:00:18,100
The agent card then shows a warning badge.

5
00:00:18,850 --> 00:00:22,534
Open the More menu of that card, and choose Free agent.

6
00:00:22,534 --> 00:00:26,944
The panel lists what the agent is holding, such as marked busy with

7
00:00:26,944 --> 00:00:30,024
no call in progress, and asks you to confirm.

8
00:00:30,024 --> 00:00:33,950
A call the provider confirms is still alive is never ended.

9
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:39,903
Free agent needs the permission to take over, end, transfer and record live

10
00:00:39,903 --> 00:00:42,344
calls, and to set agents' state.

11
00:00:42,344 --> 00:00:47,161
It releases the stale work, and the agent can be offered calls again.

12
00:00:47,161 --> 00:00:48,960
The action is audited.

